2026-08-07T09:15:12.5470907Z > #
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5471228Z > # The duckdb test suite exercises DuckDB's bundled C++ engine, which is too heavy
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5471518Z > # for CRAN's check farm, and checks were very fragile in the past. We therefore
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5471807Z > # keep it off on CRAN but run it automatically on GitHub Actions (GITHUB_ACTIONS)
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5472077Z > # and on r-universe (MY_UNIVERSE). An explicit DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS opts in
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5472373Z > # (true-ish) or out (false-ish) and always wins; otherwise we fall back to those.
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5472734Z > # This check is intentionally inlined here (rather than calling into the package)
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5473170Z > # so the guard is obvious and self-contained.
