2026-08-07T09:15:12.5475583Z +     "Skipping the duckdb test suite.\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5475680Z +     "\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5475984Z +     "The duckdb tests exercise DuckDB's bundled C++ engine and are deliberately\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5476269Z +     "NOT run on CRAN. They run automatically on GitHub Actions (including\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5476544Z +     "r-universe). This keeps check time and resource usage on CRAN within\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5476851Z +     "acceptable limits and helps release duckdb in a predictable and controlled\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5476954Z +     "manner.\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5477040Z +     "\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5477336Z +     "This is intentional, not an oversight. duckdb has an extensive test suite\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5477663Z +     "that runs continuously in our own CI; see <https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb-r>.\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5477753Z +     "\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5478062Z +     "To run the test suite locally, set the environment variable before checking:\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5478327Z +     "  Sys.setenv(DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS = \"true\")    # from within R, or\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5478992Z +     "  DUCKDB_R_RUN_TESTS=true R CMD check ...      # from the shell\n",
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5479119Z +     strrep("=", 78),
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5479211Z +     "\n"
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5479289Z +   )
2026-08-07T09:15:12.5479364Z + }
